WEBVTT

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:10.920
I am connected.

00:00:10.920 --> 00:00:12.480
To Hirukomitama.

00:00:13.170 --> 00:00:15.230
I congratulate you.

00:00:15.230 --> 00:00:16.670
Now that you have taken in the essence

00:00:16.670 --> 00:00:20.390
and have connected with your 
true form in the netherworld,

00:00:20.390 --> 00:00:24.910
your domination of this world is certain.

00:00:24.910 --> 00:00:28.110
I will continue to serve you 
to the best of my ability—

00:00:28.110 --> 00:00:29.050
Leave.

00:00:30.030 --> 00:00:31.580
What was that you said?

00:00:31.580 --> 00:00:33.550
I told you to leave.

00:00:33.550 --> 00:00:36.710
There is no longer anything for you to do.

00:00:36.710 --> 00:00:38.800
Wh-What are you saying?

00:00:39.290 --> 00:00:42.180
I have been completely loyal to you...

00:00:42.920 --> 00:00:46.260
Just who do you think you're 
pointing your swords at?!

00:00:50.630 --> 00:00:52.270
You can't...

00:00:52.980 --> 00:00:55.150
Why, Princess?

00:00:56.420 --> 00:00:58.380
Just a bit longer.

00:02:24.610 --> 00:02:28.910
<b>Katana Maidens</b>

00:02:31.200 --> 00:02:36.620
<b>Episode 22  Gate of the Netherworld</b>

00:02:35.080 --> 00:02:39.580
This is the first time she hasn't shown up.

00:02:41.020 --> 00:02:42.460
Mother...

00:03:00.880 --> 00:03:02.640
It's still expanding.

00:03:04.610 --> 00:03:06.610
<b>From
Director Maniwa
Mission Summary
Status - Emergency Call
Time - Around 7:05 AM
Location - Near Suginami Ward, Tokyo
Mission Details
 Large number of aradama incidents. 
Etou Kanami will join up with the previously deployed unit
 with standard equipment and begin suppressive action.
You have permission to use S Equipment should the situation call for it.
End</b>

00:03:07.070 --> 00:03:09.810
Okay, time to give it my all today, too!

00:03:09.810 --> 00:03:11.710
<i>There has been no statement 
from Princess Tagitsu</i>

00:03:11.710 --> 00:03:14.720
<i>or the Sword Administration Bureau 
regarding the mysterious phenomenon</i>

00:03:14.720 --> 00:03:18.530
<i>or the frequent manifestations of aradama 
that have affected the metro area.</i>

00:03:19.210 --> 00:03:20.500
What do you think?

00:03:20.870 --> 00:03:23.440
In all likelihood, they were cut down.

00:03:23.440 --> 00:03:26.560
Indeed. Now that she's fully restored,

00:03:26.560 --> 00:03:32.010
Princess Tagitsu doesn't need 
Yukina-chan or human help anymore.

00:03:32.010 --> 00:03:34.650
She couldn't have known...

00:03:35.750 --> 00:03:38.020
it would turn out like this.

00:03:38.340 --> 00:03:42.580
So, do we have any leads on 
Princess Tagitsu's whereabouts?

00:03:42.580 --> 00:03:44.320
It's not looking good.

00:03:44.320 --> 00:03:48.400
And we can't keep putting off dealing with
all these aradama that are manifesting.

00:03:48.870 --> 00:03:53.240
That is why dispatching Toji from 
Minoseki and Heijou would be helpful.

00:03:53.240 --> 00:03:58.560
Of course, Akane-chan.
That's about all that we can do.

00:03:58.560 --> 00:04:01.590
It pains me to keep putting 
the children through

00:04:01.590 --> 00:04:03.250
such horrible things like this, though.

00:04:06.040 --> 00:04:07.680
I'm sorry, Iroha-san.

00:04:08.200 --> 00:04:11.050
The children are more 
important than me right now.

00:04:11.690 --> 00:04:14.510
How are Hiyori-chan's friends 
doing at the moment?

00:04:14.900 --> 00:04:17.190
It's definitely taken a toll on them.

00:04:17.190 --> 00:04:22.430
But they each finished their aradama 
subduing missions the following day.

00:04:22.430 --> 00:04:26.280
I think they believe that 
it was the best thing to do.

00:04:26.580 --> 00:04:29.510
Etou-san's work has been 
especially remarkable,

00:04:29.510 --> 00:04:32.280
even though she has been 
the most hurt by this.

00:04:32.760 --> 00:04:34.580
She's a strong girl.

00:04:35.190 --> 00:04:37.380
She really is just like Minato.

00:04:38.470 --> 00:04:40.120
You have some too, Kanami-chan.

00:04:41.160 --> 00:04:42.630
I dunno.

00:04:42.630 --> 00:04:44.050
I want to eat them all,

00:04:44.050 --> 00:04:47.340
but if I eat too much, it'll probably 
interfere with tomorrow's mission.

00:04:47.340 --> 00:04:51.590
Don't worry. I'll take over 
for you if that happens.

00:04:52.760 --> 00:04:54.050
What is it?

00:04:54.650 --> 00:04:57.350
Are you okay, Kaoru? Do you have a fever?

00:04:57.350 --> 00:04:58.800
Whaddya mean by that?!

00:04:58.800 --> 00:05:03.190
Hey, don't put your hand on my forehead 
after eating a donut! It's sticky!

00:05:05.000 --> 00:05:07.360
I'll go with this, then.

00:05:09.260 --> 00:05:11.570
Oh, this one's mint chocolate?

00:05:11.570 --> 00:05:13.140
This is actually pretty good.

00:05:13.140 --> 00:05:16.410
Now I kind of get why Hiyori-chan 
is so fond of it.

00:05:19.960 --> 00:05:24.420
Kanami, do you really 
think we're all clueless?

00:05:25.430 --> 00:05:27.450
Oh, you mean this other cookie?

00:05:28.200 --> 00:05:30.170
Guess I've been found out.

00:05:30.170 --> 00:05:32.740
Please stop it, Kanami-chan.

00:05:32.740 --> 00:05:37.050
We all know that you've been 
under a lot of strain, Kanamin.

00:05:37.550 --> 00:05:40.310
Even I can tell you're forcing it.

00:05:40.710 --> 00:05:42.230
What do you mean, forcing it?

00:05:42.230 --> 00:05:45.230
Come on, do I really seem that off?

00:05:45.230 --> 00:05:47.310
You don't have to laugh if you don't want to!

00:05:51.320 --> 00:05:57.450
I told Hiyori-chan that being alone 
was tough, and I would share the load.

00:06:01.170 --> 00:06:05.960
But at the most crucial moment, 
I couldn't reach out to her.

00:06:12.170 --> 00:06:14.290
I couldn't keep my promise, either.

00:06:14.290 --> 00:06:17.470
And, in the end, all of it fell on her.

00:06:18.010 --> 00:06:20.780
I couldn't do a single thing about it.

00:06:24.650 --> 00:06:30.080
Kanami-chan, we all feel 
the same way you do, okay?

00:06:30.920 --> 00:06:32.410
Mai-chan?

00:06:33.560 --> 00:06:36.070
She's right. It's the same for us.

00:06:43.380 --> 00:06:46.330
We also couldn't keep our promise.

00:06:46.770 --> 00:06:51.210
I'm sorry that all the hardship 
has been forced on you.

00:06:53.690 --> 00:06:56.220
Y-Yeah...

00:06:56.530 --> 00:07:02.330
So, please, Kanami-chan, you don't 
have to tough it out anymore.

00:07:04.600 --> 00:07:05.660
Okay.

00:07:19.810 --> 00:07:24.260
I'm okay now. Sorry for being so much trouble.

00:07:24.260 --> 00:07:26.130
It's no trouble at all!

00:07:26.950 --> 00:07:29.630
You're always the one helping us.

00:07:30.310 --> 00:07:33.390
Well, to keep being trouble, 
I have a favor to ask you.

00:07:36.940 --> 00:07:38.000
Snow?

00:07:51.020 --> 00:07:53.070
A-Aradama? Damn it!

00:07:58.470 --> 00:08:00.300
It's opened!

00:08:02.350 --> 00:08:04.870
Aradama keep springing 
forth from the netherworld

00:08:04.870 --> 00:08:07.730
and the fully-restored Princess Tagitsu.

00:08:07.730 --> 00:08:10.720
It's like a repeat of the 
incident from twenty years ago.

00:08:10.720 --> 00:08:14.270
Can I leave field command 
to you, Director Maniwa?

00:08:14.270 --> 00:08:18.080
I am ashamed to ask you that, since I 
am acting bureau director in name only.

00:08:18.080 --> 00:08:20.610
That's an unreasonable request, Akane-chan.

00:08:20.610 --> 00:08:23.930
Twenty years ago, I was just a soldier, too.

00:08:25.450 --> 00:08:30.740
But we can't just leave everything to 
the children while the adults escape.

00:08:30.740 --> 00:08:33.150
Sorry for interrupting when 
things have been settled, but...

00:08:33.150 --> 00:08:36.150
I have an idea about who
 should be field commander.

00:08:36.530 --> 00:08:37.650
Yukari!

00:08:36.530 --> 00:08:37.650
Yukari-chan!

00:08:37.990 --> 00:08:40.570
Nee-sama, where have you been all this time?

00:08:40.910 --> 00:08:44.720
She's completely stubborn, and it
 took a bit to convince her.

00:08:44.720 --> 00:08:47.330
I would rather you didn't say that, Yukari.

00:08:47.330 --> 00:08:49.040
Yuzuki?!

00:08:47.330 --> 00:08:49.040
Yuzuki-san?!

00:08:47.330 --> 00:08:49.040
Yuzuki-senpai?!

00:08:49.410 --> 00:08:54.040
Can I count on your cooperation?

00:08:54.040 --> 00:08:56.430
The Demon Yuzuki has been resurrected!

00:08:56.430 --> 00:08:59.790
Yes, even Minato was afraid of Demon Yuzuki.

00:08:59.790 --> 00:09:02.640
Yes! Demon, devil, Yuzuki-senpai!

00:09:02.640 --> 00:09:04.800
W-Was I that bad?

00:09:06.070 --> 00:09:07.220
Nee-sama?

00:09:07.620 --> 00:09:09.730
Akane, I leave the rest to you.

00:09:10.080 --> 00:09:11.020
Nee-sa—

00:09:11.830 --> 00:09:14.210
Director, I have a favor to ask you!

00:09:14.730 --> 00:09:19.270
We settled on President Souraku 
as commander just now,

00:09:19.270 --> 00:09:20.860
but what is it? Tell us.

00:09:21.420 --> 00:09:23.990
Please dispatch us to fight.

00:09:23.990 --> 00:09:26.290
At the very least, please allow 
us to get back Kogarasumaru,

00:09:26.290 --> 00:09:29.500
Hiyori-chan's okatana!

00:09:40.630 --> 00:09:41.720
H-Hey!

00:09:45.300 --> 00:09:48.530
It's almost like the world is ending.

00:09:48.530 --> 00:09:51.760
That'll really happen if we end up losing.

00:09:51.760 --> 00:09:53.360
Mai, there!

00:09:58.190 --> 00:10:01.190
Yes, that's where Princess Tagitsu is.

00:10:01.190 --> 00:10:06.180
Just watch, Hiyori-chan. We'll get
 Kogarasumaru back for sure.

00:10:06.950 --> 00:10:10.830
Ready, everyone? For what we will need to do.

00:10:10.830 --> 00:10:12.810
You don't need to tell us.

00:10:13.750 --> 00:10:16.630
Yes! I'm sure we're all in agreement.

00:10:16.930 --> 00:10:18.500
Leave it to us, Mai.

00:10:20.090 --> 00:10:23.430
We will cut a path through for Kanami-chan.

00:10:23.430 --> 00:10:25.810
Mai-chan, everyone...

00:10:26.230 --> 00:10:28.130
We'll cover your back.

00:10:28.130 --> 00:10:29.260
Huh?

00:10:29.260 --> 00:10:32.020
You all just keep looking straight ahead.

00:10:32.020 --> 00:10:34.370
Shidou-san and Konohana-san, too!

00:10:34.370 --> 00:10:36.270
There's still more, Kanamin.

00:10:36.270 --> 00:10:38.400
<b>Special Rare Metals Research Division 

00:10:36.270 --> 00:10:38.400
Speaker

00:10:36.270 --> 00:10:38.400
Keyboard

00:10:36.270 --> 00:10:38.400
Mute

00:10:36.730 --> 00:10:38.400
<i>Can everyone hear me?</i>

00:10:38.400 --> 00:10:39.620
Rui-san?

00:10:39.620 --> 00:10:44.150
<i>It's a bit soon, but take this.
 It's a present from us.</i>

00:10:47.820 --> 00:10:50.560
Storm armor?

00:10:50.560 --> 00:10:54.610
<i>Correct, but it's not just any storm armor.</i>

00:10:54.610 --> 00:10:55.960
Friedman-san!

00:10:55.960 --> 00:10:59.590
It's a new model with drastically 
improved operation time.

00:10:59.590 --> 00:11:01.810
Be sure to make it back, okay?

00:11:01.810 --> 00:11:04.720
I'll treat you to all kinds
 of sweets if you do!

00:11:05.110 --> 00:11:06.090
Yes, ma'am!

00:11:12.290 --> 00:11:15.980
Yukari, all units are in place. Are we ready?

00:11:16.420 --> 00:11:18.350
No problems here. Go ahead.

00:11:18.350 --> 00:11:21.110
Then, mission start!

00:11:24.110 --> 00:11:25.900
Kaoru-chan, please!

00:11:25.900 --> 00:11:26.930
Got it!

00:11:28.490 --> 00:11:29.410
Nene!

00:11:35.750 --> 00:11:37.440
Nene, you're amazing!

00:11:37.440 --> 00:11:38.820
Kanami-chan, go on ahead!

00:11:38.820 --> 00:11:39.630
Okay!

00:11:39.880 --> 00:11:42.630
Yukari-sama, please take care of Kanami-chan!

00:11:45.630 --> 00:11:49.380
<i>I wouldn't have been able to catch up with 
you if we'd gotten stronger together.</i>

00:11:50.590 --> 00:11:51.890
Etou-san!

00:11:52.560 --> 00:11:53.260
Not so fast!

00:11:54.960 --> 00:11:55.890
Etou-san!

00:11:55.890 --> 00:11:57.140
Sayaka-chan!

00:11:57.140 --> 00:11:58.140
Go!

00:11:58.140 --> 00:11:59.140
Okay!

00:12:14.010 --> 00:12:15.700
Why me?

00:12:16.050 --> 00:12:17.230
Why?

00:12:29.350 --> 00:12:31.430
What do you want?

00:12:33.810 --> 00:12:36.750
Give Kogarasumaru back.

00:12:42.310 --> 00:12:44.210
What's wrong, Chidori?

00:12:51.480 --> 00:12:52.990
So that's what it is.

00:12:53.390 --> 00:12:55.370
She's alive, Etou Kanami.

00:12:55.370 --> 00:12:56.240
Huh?

00:12:56.240 --> 00:13:01.460
Juujou Hiyori is still alive! 
Inside Princess Tagitsu.

00:13:01.460 --> 00:13:04.380
That resonance is Kogarasumaru's 
will and knowledge!

00:13:04.720 --> 00:13:07.490
Hiyori-chan is...

00:13:10.380 --> 00:13:11.820
still alive?

00:13:13.030 --> 00:13:15.970
I see...

00:13:17.240 --> 00:13:18.220
<i>That means...</i>

00:13:19.600 --> 00:13:21.700
This is no time to be crying!

00:13:21.700 --> 00:13:23.690
For Chidori or myself!

00:13:39.520 --> 00:13:40.700
Princess Tagitsu!

00:13:43.790 --> 00:13:44.750
Stay back!

00:13:44.750 --> 00:13:46.630
Stay back! Stay back! Stay back!

00:13:46.630 --> 00:13:49.880
Pathetic aradama, just who
 do you think I am?!

00:13:50.290 --> 00:13:52.380
No, stay away!

00:13:53.340 --> 00:13:54.580
No!

00:13:57.790 --> 00:14:00.350
Why isn't anyone here?

00:14:02.600 --> 00:14:06.290
I served you as much as I could! 
I loved you more than anything!

00:14:06.290 --> 00:14:09.780
Why then? Princess! Yukari-sama!

00:14:09.780 --> 00:14:11.990
Why have you forsaken me?!

00:14:11.990 --> 00:14:16.040
Don't cast me aside!
Don't leave me all alone...

00:14:18.510 --> 00:14:20.130
Wh-What?

00:14:34.470 --> 00:14:37.090
Suijingiri Kanemitsu?

00:14:38.040 --> 00:14:40.240
Yomi?

00:15:02.240 --> 00:15:04.470
Why are you getting in my way?

00:15:04.470 --> 00:15:07.120
This has nothing to do with you, Itomi-san.

00:15:07.550 --> 00:15:11.630
That's not true. I am like a senpai to you.

00:15:13.450 --> 00:15:16.550
I know. You ran away, didn't you?

00:15:17.110 --> 00:15:19.550
Because I found something more important.

00:15:19.550 --> 00:15:22.260
What could be more important 
than getting stronger?!

00:15:24.520 --> 00:15:28.100
<i>Right, right again, then left.</i>

00:15:29.390 --> 00:15:30.110
Why?

00:15:33.640 --> 00:15:35.690
Why can't I catch up?

00:15:36.060 --> 00:15:38.450
To you or Etou-san!

00:15:44.150 --> 00:15:46.290
Now it's my turn to save someone.

00:15:48.300 --> 00:15:50.710
You won't be able to cut anything...

00:15:51.750 --> 00:15:53.710
...with a soulless sword like that!

00:16:01.300 --> 00:16:04.170
Because I just put
 everything into this strike.

00:16:04.990 --> 00:16:12.520
Ah, I think I understand now, Etou-san...

00:16:15.500 --> 00:16:19.390
I'm sure you feel this heat, too.

00:16:23.530 --> 00:16:25.200
No more, no more...

00:16:54.470 --> 00:16:59.450
I thought you had finally died,
but your tenacity is something else.

00:17:02.080 --> 00:17:04.950
If you want more power, 
I will give it to you.

00:17:06.700 --> 00:17:12.690
Don't worry, you have qualities 
suitable for receiving this power.

00:17:13.390 --> 00:17:16.100
You utterly useless guinea pig.

00:17:16.100 --> 00:17:19.370
Have you come to mock me, 
now that I've lost everything?

00:17:28.540 --> 00:17:30.960
Go away! Don't come any closer!

00:17:34.520 --> 00:17:37.440
Stay back! Stay back! Stay back!

00:17:37.440 --> 00:17:39.030
Stay back!

00:17:42.390 --> 00:17:43.410
I have returned,

00:17:44.280 --> 00:17:48.200
President Takatsu.

00:17:54.870 --> 00:17:57.740
Yomi, you...

00:18:01.310 --> 00:18:02.300
Thank you

00:18:02.300 --> 00:18:04.970
for your hard work, Yomi.

00:18:34.390 --> 00:18:35.750
My utsushi is exhausted.

00:18:35.750 --> 00:18:41.020
My apologies. It's difficult to lower 
my strength to deal with flies.

00:18:47.760 --> 00:18:50.090
Not yet... not yet!

00:18:53.530 --> 00:18:58.690
Is this it? Where's the technique 
you tried to kill me with before?

00:19:03.710 --> 00:19:04.900
...er back..

00:19:04.900 --> 00:19:06.200
What's that?

00:19:06.200 --> 00:19:08.660
Give Hiyori-chan back!

00:19:10.530 --> 00:19:11.950
Fool!

00:19:25.340 --> 00:19:27.430
Such incredible emotional strength...

00:19:27.430 --> 00:19:30.140
Give her back, give her back, give her back!

00:19:31.670 --> 00:19:33.100
<i>This is...</i>

00:19:38.690 --> 00:19:40.150
Hiyori-chan!

00:19:40.480 --> 00:19:43.610
Is it because she cares about Juujou Hiyori?

00:19:51.530 --> 00:19:53.090
Come back!

00:19:53.090 --> 00:19:55.910
I'm right here, Hiyori-chan!

00:20:08.230 --> 00:20:10.800
Good grief.

00:20:10.800 --> 00:20:13.500
It doesn't matter where I go.

00:20:23.990 --> 00:20:25.070
Kanami!

00:20:40.310 --> 00:20:41.290
Hiyo—

00:20:47.020 --> 00:20:49.840
Your voice really carries.

00:20:50.750 --> 00:20:52.410
Hiyori-chan!

00:20:54.760 --> 00:20:58.800
So you little chicks have managed 
to become a couple of lovebirds.

00:20:58.800 --> 00:21:00.520
While this is certainly a happy occasion,

00:21:01.770 --> 00:21:03.980
this ends here.

00:21:05.190 --> 00:21:07.150
I don't think so!

00:21:11.880 --> 00:21:13.200
Yukari...

00:21:24.300 --> 00:21:27.630
That was a shock, but this is...

00:21:28.280 --> 00:21:29.510
Nene-chan?

00:21:35.010 --> 00:21:37.410
Thank goodness. We made it.

00:21:37.410 --> 00:21:39.640
You're all right, Hiyoyon!

00:21:39.640 --> 00:21:42.500
You've got a lot of nerve, 
coming back like this.

00:21:42.500 --> 00:21:45.470
What you lack in your chest, 
you make up for with boldness.

00:21:45.470 --> 00:21:47.760
But you were the most worried, Kaoru.

00:21:47.760 --> 00:21:49.150
Ow, ow...

00:21:57.480 --> 00:22:00.770
I'm sorry for worrying you, and...

00:22:02.520 --> 00:22:03.840
Thank you.

00:23:34.880 --> 00:23:39.890
<b>Next Episode  Moment's End</b>
